* TS922 con el macromodelo OFICIAL de ST (models/ts92x.lib, subcircuito TS92X).
* Orden de pines de ST: 1 IN-, 2 IN+, 3 OUT, 4 V+, 5 V-.
* Envoltorios con el orden del simbolo opamp2 de LTspice (In+ In- V+ V- OUT).
.include ts92x.lib
.subckt TS922 INP INN VP VN OUT params: VOS=0
X1 INN INP OUT VP VN TS92X
.ends TS922
.subckt OPA INP INN VP VN OUT params: VOS=0
X1 INN INP OUT VP VN TS92X
.ends OPA
